  </script> </head> <body class="fixed-top-nav "> <header> <nav id="navbar" class="navbar navbar-light navbar-expand-sm fixed-top" role="navigation"> <div class="container"> <a class="navbar-brand title font-weight-lighter" href="/"> <span class="font-weight-bold">Zainab</span> D. Altaweel </a> <button class="navbar-toggler collapsed navbar-toggler-main" type="button" data-nav-toggle="navbarNav" aria-controls="navbarNav" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Toggle navigation"> <span class="sr-only">Toggle navigation</span> <span class="icon-bar top-bar"></span> <span class="icon-bar middle-bar"></span> <span class="icon-bar bottom-bar"></span> </button> <div class="collapse navbar-collapse navbar-collapse-main" id="navbarNav"> <ul class="navbar-nav navbar-menu-list flex-nowrap"> <li class="nav-item "> <a class="nav-link" href="/">about </a> </li> <li class="nav-item "> <a class="nav-link" href="/blog/">blog </a> </li> <li class="nav-item "> <a class="nav-link" href="/publications/">publications </a> </li> <li class="nav-item "> <a class="nav-link" href="/projects/">projects </a> </li> <li class="nav-item "> <a class="nav-link" href="/repositories/">repositories </a> </li> <li class="nav-item active"> <a class="nav-link" href="/cv/">CV <span class="sr-only">(current)</span> </a> </li> <li class="nav-item "> <a class="nav-link" href="/teaching/">teaching </a> </li> <li class="nav-item "> <a class="nav-link" href="/people/">people </a> </li> <li class="nav-item dropdown "> <a class="nav-link dropdown-toggle" href="#" id="navbarDropdown" role="button" data-nav-dropdown-toggle="true" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false">submenus </a> <div class="dropdown-menu dropdown-menu-right" aria-labelledby="navbarDropdown"> <a class="dropdown-item " href="/books/">bookshelf</a> <div class="dropdown-divider"></div> <a class="dropdown-item " href="/blog/">blog</a> </div> </li> <li class="toggle-container"> <button id="light-toggle" type="button" title="Change theme" aria-label="Change color theme"> <i class="fa-half-sun-moon" id="light-toggle-system"></i> <i class="fa-solid fa-moon" id="light-toggle-dark"></i> <i class="fa-solid fa-sun" id="light-toggle-light"></i> </button> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </nav> <progress id="progress" value="0"> <div class="progress-container"> <span class="progress-bar"></span> </div> </progress> </header> <div class="container mt-5" role="main"> <div class="row"> <div class="col-sm-3"> <nav id="toc-sidebar" class="sticky-top toc toc-sidebar" aria-label="Table of contents" data-toc-collapse="expanded" data-toc-collapse-depth=""></nav> </div> <div class="col-sm-9"> <div class="post"> <header class="post-header"> <h1 class="post-title"> CV <a href="/assets/pdf/example_pdf.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="float-right"> <i class="fa-solid fa-file-pdf"></i> </a> </h1> <p class="post-description">This is a description of the page. You can modify it in '_pages/cv.md'. You can also change or remove the top pdf download button.</p> </header> <article> <div class="cv"> <div class="card mt-3 p-3"> <h3 class="card-title font-weight-medium">Contact Information</h3> <table class="table table-cv table-sm table-borderless"> <tr> <td class="p-1 pr-2 font-weight-bold"><b>Name</b></td> <td class="p-1 pl-2 font-weight-light">Zainab Altaweel</td> </tr> <tr> <td class="p-1 pr-2 font-weight-bold"><b>Professional Title</b></td> <td class="p-1 pl-2 font-weight-light">Ph.D. Student, Computer Science</td> </tr> <tr> <td class="p-1 pr-2 font-weight-bold"><b>Email</b></td> <td class="p-1 pl-2 font-weight-light">zaltaweel@binghamton.edu</td> </tr> </table> </div> <div class="card mt-3 p-3"> <h3 class="card-title font-weight-medium">Professional Summary</h3> <p>Ph.D. student in the School of Computing at Binghamton University, working with the AIR Research Group on the security and robustness of learned robot policies. </p> </div> <a class="anchor" id="experience"></a> <div class="card mt-3 p-3"> <h3 class="card-title font-weight-medium">Experience</h3> <div> <ul class="card-text font-weight-light list-group list-group-flush"> <li class="list-group-item"> <div class="row"> <div class="col-xs-2 col-sm-2 col-md-2 text-center date-column"> <table class="table-cv"> <tbody> <tr> <td> <span class="badge font-weight-bold danger-color-dark text-uppercase align-middle" style="min-width: 75px">2023 - present</span> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <p class="location"> <i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot iconlocation"></i> Binghamton, NY </p> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <div class="col-xs-10 col-sm-10 col-md-10 mt-2 mt-md-0"> <h6 class="title font-weight-bold ml-1 ml-md-4"> Graduate Teaching Assistant </h6> <h6 class="ml-1 ml-md-4" style="font-size: 0.95rem"> Binghamton University </h6> </div> </div> </li> <li class="list-group-item"> <div class="row"> <div class="col-xs-2 col-sm-2 col-md-2 text-center date-column"> <table class="table-cv"> <tbody> <tr> <td> <span class="badge font-weight-bold danger-color-dark text-uppercase align-middle" style="min-width: 75px">2026 - 2026</span> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <div class="col-xs-10 col-sm-10 col-md-10 mt-2 mt-md-0"> <h6 class="title font-weight-bold ml-1 ml-md-4"> Program Committee Member </h6> <h6 class="ml-1 ml-md-4" style="font-size: 0.95rem"> AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence — AI for Social Impact (AISI) Track </h6> <h6 class="ml-1 ml-md-4" style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-style: italic"> Reviewed and evaluated three submitted papers. </h6> </div> </div> </li> <li class="list-group-item"> <div class="row"> <div class="col-xs-2 col-sm-2 col-md-2 text-center date-column"> <table class="table-cv"> <tbody> <tr> <td> <span class="badge font-weight-bold danger-color-dark text-uppercase align-middle" style="min-width: 75px">2026 - 2026</span> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <div class="col-xs-10 col-sm-10 col-md-10 mt-2 mt-md-0"> <h6 class="title font-weight-bold ml-1 ml-md-4"> Reviewer </h6> <h6 class="ml-1 ml-md-4" style="font-size: 0.95rem"> CoRL 2026 </h6> <h6 class="ml-1 ml-md-4" style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-style: italic"> Reviewed three submissions, including full reviews with detailed feedback. </h6> </div> </div> </li> <li class="list-group-item"> <div class="row"> <div class="col-xs-2 col-sm-2 col-md-2 text-center date-column"> <table class="table-cv"> <tbody> <tr> <td> <span class="badge font-weight-bold danger-color-dark text-uppercase align-middle" style="min-width: 75px">2020 - 2023</span> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <p class="location"> <i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot iconlocation"></i> Stratford, CT </p> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <div class="col-xs-10 col-sm-10 col-md-10 mt-2 mt-md-0"> <h6 class="title font-weight-bold ml-1 ml-md-4"> Software Developer </h6> <h6 class="ml-1 ml-md-4" style="font-size: 0.95rem"> Kubtec Medical Imaging </h6> <h6 class="ml-1 ml-md-4" style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-style: italic"> Hardware-software integration for medical imaging (C#, WPF, SQL). </h6> </div> </div> </li> <li class="list-group-item"> <div class="row"> <div class="col-xs-2 col-sm-2 col-md-2 text-center date-column"> <table class="table-cv"> <tbody> <tr> <td> <span class="badge font-weight-bold danger-color-dark text-uppercase align-middle" style="min-width: 75px">2020 - 2023</span> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <p class="location"> <i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot iconlocation"></i> Kerbala, Iraq </p> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <div class="col-xs-10 col-sm-10 col-md-10 mt-2 mt-md-0"> <h6 class="title font-weight-bold ml-1 ml-md-4"> Assistant Lecturer / Researcher </h6> <h6 class="ml-1 ml-md-4" style="font-size: 0.95rem"> University of Kerbala </h6> </div> </div> </li> <li class="list-group-item"> <div class="row"> <div class="col-xs-2 col-sm-2 col-md-2 text-center date-column"> <table class="table-cv"> <tbody> <tr> <td> <span class="badge font-weight-bold danger-color-dark text-uppercase align-middle" style="min-width: 75px">2017 - 2018</span> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <p class="location"> <i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot iconlocation"></i> Kerbala, Iraq </p> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <div class="col-xs-10 col-sm-10 col-md-10 mt-2 mt-md-0"> <h6 class="title font-weight-bold ml-1 ml-md-4"> Assistant Lecturer / Researcher </h6> <h6 class="ml-1 ml-md-4" style="font-size: 0.95rem"> University of Kerbala </h6> </div> </div> </li> <li class="list-group-item"> <div class="row"> <div class="col-xs-2 col-sm-2 col-md-2 text-center date-column"> <table class="table-cv"> <tbody> <tr> <td> <span class="badge font-weight-bold danger-color-dark text-uppercase align-middle" style="min-width: 75px">2014 - 2017</span> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <p class="location"> <i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot iconlocation"></i> Baghdad, Iraq </p> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <div class="col-xs-10 col-sm-10 col-md-10 mt-2 mt-md-0"> <h6 class="title font-weight-bold ml-1 ml-md-4"> Teaching Assistant / Network Administrator </h6> <h6 class="ml-1 ml-md-4" style="font-size: 0.95rem"> Al-Nahrain University </h6> </div> </div> </li> </ul> </div> </div> <a class="anchor" id="education"></a> <div class="card mt-3 p-3"> <h3 class="card-title font-weight-medium">Education</h3> <div> <ul class="card-text font-weight-light list-group list-group-flush"> <li class="list-group-item"> <div class="row"> <div class="col-xs-2 col-sm-2 col-md-2 text-center date-column"> <table class="table-cv"> <tbody> <tr> <td> <span class="badge font-weight-bold danger-color-dark text-uppercase align-middle" style="min-width: 75px">2023 - present</span> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <p class="location"> <i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot iconlocation"></i> Binghamton, NY </p> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <div class="col-xs-10 col-sm-10 col-md-10 mt-2 mt-md-0"> <h6 class="title font-weight-bold ml-1 ml-md-4"> PhD </h6> <h6 class="ml-1 ml-md-4" style="font-size: 0.95rem">Binghamton University</h6> <h6 class="ml-1 ml-md-4" style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-style: italic">Computer Science</h6> </div> </div> </li> <li class="list-group-item"> <div class="row"> <div class="col-xs-2 col-sm-2 col-md-2 text-center date-column"> <table class="table-cv"> <tbody> <tr> <td> <span class="badge font-weight-bold danger-color-dark text-uppercase align-middle" style="min-width: 75px">2018 - 2020</span> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <p class="location"> <i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot iconlocation"></i> Bridgeport, CT </p> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <div class="col-xs-10 col-sm-10 col-md-10 mt-2 mt-md-0"> <h6 class="title font-weight-bold ml-1 ml-md-4"> MS </h6> <h6 class="ml-1 ml-md-4" style="font-size: 0.95rem">University of Bridgeport</h6> <h6 class="ml-1 ml-md-4" style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-style: italic">Computer Engineering</h6> <ul class="items"> <li> <span class="item">Fulbright Foreign Student Program Scholar </span> </li> <li> <span class="item">Thesis: speech signal enhancement via sequence-to-sequence attention model </span> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </li> <li class="list-group-item"> <div class="row"> <div class="col-xs-2 col-sm-2 col-md-2 text-center date-column"> <table class="table-cv"> <tbody> <tr> <td> <span class="badge font-weight-bold danger-color-dark text-uppercase align-middle" style="min-width: 75px">2010 - 2014</span> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <p class="location"> <i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot iconlocation"></i> Baghdad, Iraq </p> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <div class="col-xs-10 col-sm-10 col-md-10 mt-2 mt-md-0"> <h6 class="title font-weight-bold ml-1 ml-md-4"> BS </h6> <h6 class="ml-1 ml-md-4" style="font-size: 0.95rem">Al-Nahrain University</h6> <h6 class="ml-1 ml-md-4" style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-style: italic">Computer Engineering</h6> </div> </div> </li> </ul> </div> </div> <a class="anchor" id="awards"></a> <div class="card mt-3 p-3"> <h3 class="card-title font-weight-medium">Awards</h3> <div> <ul class="card-text font-weight-light list-group list-group-flush"> <li class="list-group-item"> <div class="row"> <div class="col-xs-2 col-sm-2 col-md-2 text-center"> <table class="table-cv"> <tbody> <tr> <td> <span class="badge font-weight-bold danger-color-dark text-uppercase align-middle" style="min-width: 75px">2018</span> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <div class="col-xs-10 col-sm-10 col-md-10 mt-2 mt-md-0"> <h6 class="title font-weight-bold ml-1 ml-md-4">Fulbright Foreign Student Program Scholar</h6> <h6 class="ml-1 ml-md-4" style="font-size: 0.95rem">Fulbright Foreign Student Program</h6> <p class="ml-1 ml-md-4">Awarded to complete a master’s degree in Computer Engineering at the University of Bridgeport (2018-2020). </p> </div> </div> </li> <li class="list-group-item"> <div class="row"> <div class="col-xs-2 col-sm-2 col-md-2 text-center"> <table class="table-cv"> <tbody> <tr> <td> <span class="badge font-weight-bold danger-color-dark text-uppercase align-middle" style="min-width: 75px">2025</span> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <div class="col-xs-10 col-sm-10 col-md-10 mt-2 mt-md-0"> <h6 class="title font-weight-bold ml-1 ml-md-4">Graduate School Travel Grant</h6> <h6 class="ml-1 ml-md-4" style="font-size: 0.95rem">Binghamton University Graduate School</h6> <p class="ml-1 ml-md-4">To attend RSS 2025 and present “Attacking LLM-based Robot Intelligence for Long-horizon Tasks” at the RSS 2025 Workshop on Reliable Robotics. </p> </div> </div> </li> <li class="list-group-item"> <div class="row"> <div class="col-xs-2 col-sm-2 col-md-2 text-center"> <table class="table-cv"> <tbody> <tr> <td> <span class="badge font-weight-bold danger-color-dark text-uppercase align-middle" style="min-width: 75px">2025</span> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <div class="col-xs-10 col-sm-10 col-md-10 mt-2 mt-md-0"> <h6 class="title font-weight-bold ml-1 ml-md-4">AAAI 2025 Travel Award</h6> <h6 class="ml-1 ml-md-4" style="font-size: 0.95rem">AAAI</h6> <p class="ml-1 ml-md-4">To attend AAAI 2025 and present “Safety First: a Dataset of Harmful Task Plans for Robots” at the Workshop on Datasets and Evaluators of AI Safety. </p> </div> </div> </li> <li class="list-group-item"> <div class="row"> <div class="col-xs-2 col-sm-2 col-md-2 text-center"> <table class="table-cv"> <tbody> <tr> <td> <span class="badge font-weight-bold danger-color-dark text-uppercase align-middle" style="min-width: 75px">2020</span> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <div class="col-xs-10 col-sm-10 col-md-10 mt-2 mt-md-0"> <h6 class="title font-weight-bold ml-1 ml-md-4">Member, Upsilon Pi Epsilon Honor Society</h6> <h6 class="ml-1 ml-md-4" style="font-size: 0.95rem">Connecticut Delta Chapter, Upsilon Pi Epsilon</h6> <p class="ml-1 ml-md-4">Computer science honor society membership. </p> </div> </div> </li> </ul> </div> </div> <a class="anchor" id="publications"></a> <div class="card mt-3 p-3"> <h3 class="card-title font-weight-medium">Publications</h3> <div> <ul class="card-text font-weight-light list-group list-group-flush"> <li class="list-group-item"> <div class="row"> <div class="col-xs-2 col-sm-2 col-md-2 text-center"> <table class="table-cv"> <tbody> <tr> <td> <span class="badge font-weight-bold danger-color-dark text-uppercase align-middle" style="min-width: 75px">2026</span> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <div class="col-xs-10 col-sm-10 col-md-10 mt-2 mt-md-0"> <h6 class="title font-weight-bold ml-1 ml-md-4">PROTEA: Securing Robot Task Planning and Execution</h6> <h6 class="ml-1 ml-md-4" style="font-size: 0.95rem"> <em>IROS 2026</em> </h6> <p class="ml-1 ml-md-4">Accepted for publication. </p> </div> </div> </li> <li class="list-group-item"> <div class="row"> <div class="col-xs-2 col-sm-2 col-md-2 text-center"> <table class="table-cv"> <tbody> <tr> <td> <span class="badge font-weight-bold danger-color-dark text-uppercase align-middle" style="min-width: 75px">2026</span> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <div class="col-xs-10 col-sm-10 col-md-10 mt-2 mt-md-0"> <h6 class="title font-weight-bold ml-1 ml-md-4">MuTRAP: Multi-trigger Trojans Attacking Robot Task Planning Systems</h6> <h6 class="ml-1 ml-md-4" style="font-size: 0.95rem"> <em>IROS 2026</em> </h6> <p class="ml-1 ml-md-4">Equal contribution (Al Nahian &amp; Altaweel). Accepted for publication. </p> </div> </div> </li> <li class="list-group-item"> <div class="row"> <div class="col-xs-2 col-sm-2 col-md-2 text-center"> <table class="table-cv"> <tbody> <tr> <td> <span class="badge font-weight-bold danger-color-dark text-uppercase align-middle" style="min-width: 75px">2025</span> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <div class="col-xs-10 col-sm-10 col-md-10 mt-2 mt-md-0"> <h6 class="title font-weight-bold ml-1 ml-md-4"> <a href="https://robotics.cs.binghamton.edu/papers/2025_IJRR_LLM_GROP.pdf">LLM-GROP: Visually Grounded Robot Task and Motion Planning with Large Language Models</a> </h6> <h6 class="ml-1 ml-md-4" style="font-size: 0.95rem"> <em>International Journal of Robotics Research (IJRR)</em> </h6> </div> </div> </li> <li class="list-group-item"> <div class="row"> <div class="col-xs-2 col-sm-2 col-md-2 text-center"> <table class="table-cv"> <tbody> <tr> <td> <span class="badge font-weight-bold danger-color-dark text-uppercase align-middle" style="min-width: 75px">2025</span> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <div class="col-xs-10 col-sm-10 col-md-10 mt-2 mt-md-0"> <h6 class="title font-weight-bold ml-1 ml-md-4"> <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.17070">Robo-Troj: Attacking LLM-Based Task Planners</a> </h6> <h6 class="ml-1 ml-md-4" style="font-size: 0.95rem"> <em>RSS 2025 Workshop on Reliable Robotics: Safety and Security in the Face of Generative AI</em> </h6> </div> </div> </li> <li class="list-group-item"> <div class="row"> <div class="col-xs-2 col-sm-2 col-md-2 text-center"> <table class="table-cv"> <tbody> <tr> <td> <span class="badge font-weight-bold danger-color-dark text-uppercase align-middle" style="min-width: 75px">2025</span> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <div class="col-xs-10 col-sm-10 col-md-10 mt-2 mt-md-0"> <h6 class="title f